        "id": "docs/knowledge-base/architecture.md::architecture_the_shipped_system",
        "source": "docs/knowledge-base/architecture.md",
        "kind": "verbatim_excerpt",
        "heading": "Architecture — The Shipped System",
        "text": "# Architecture — The Shipped System This describes the canonical V0 implementation on `main` (status checked 2026-08-27). Where a claim in an older research doc is now outdated by shipped code, this file reflects the code. Paths are repo-relative.",
        "evidence": {
          "file": "docs/knowledge-base/architecture.md",
          "sha256": "1497944060481389639f54b29cc4b5c0e3b3e9bc1b5e8c0da6d0eba07adc84d4",
